Tarifa Base Normal (TBN) | Para todo tipo de vehículo | 1,0
Tarifa Base Punta (TBP) | 1 | 2,0
| 2 | 2,0
| 3 | 3,0
| 4 | 2,5
| 5 | 2,0
| 6 | 2,0
| 7 | 2,0
